{"docKey":"0761_special_binary_string","code":"class Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    特殊的二进制字符串 - 递归 + 排序\n\n    核心思路：\n    1. 特殊二进制字符串可以看作「合法括号序列」\n    2. 分解为不可再分的特殊子串\n    3. 每个子串去掉外层括号后递归处理\n    4. 按字典序降序排列后拼接\n\n    时间复杂度: O(n^2 log n)\n    空间复杂度: O(n)\n    \"\"\"\n    def makeLargestSpecial(self, s: str) -> str:\n        if len(s) <= 2:\n            return s\n\n        substrings = []\n        diff = 0\n        start = 0\n\n        for i, ch in enumerate(s):\n            if ch == '1':\n                diff += 1\n            else:\n                diff -= 1\n                if diff == 0:\n                    inner = self.makeLargestSpecial(s[start+1:i])\n                    substrings.append(\"1\" + inner + \"0\")\n                    start = i + 1\n\n        substrings.sort(reverse=True)\n        return ''.join(substrings)","method":"makeLargestSpecial","paramNames":["s"],"args":["\"11011000\""],"expected":"\"11100100\"","result":"11100100","events":[{"line":15,"locals":{"s":"11011000"},"depth":1},{"line":18,"locals":{"s":"11011000"},"depth":1},{"line":19,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[]},"depth":1},{"line":20,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":0},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":0,"start":0},"depth":1},{"line":23,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":0,"start":0,"i":0,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":24,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":0,"start":0,"i":0,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":1,"start":0,"i":0,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":23,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":1,"start":0,"i":1,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":24,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":1,"start":0,"i":1,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":2,"start":0,"i":1,"ch":"1"},"depth":1},{"line":23,"locals":{"s":"11011000","substrings":[],"diff":2,"start":0,"i":2,"ch":"0"},"depth":1},{"line":26,"locals":{"s":"11011000